{'symbol': 'MTD', 'date': '2022-11-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'METTLER-TOLEDO INTERNATIONAL INC. ANNOUNCES INGRID ZHANG TO JOIN BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OH, NOV. 07, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- METTLER-TOLEDO INTERNATIONAL INC. (NYSE:MTD) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT INGRID ZHANG HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 1, 2023. THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT WAH-HUI CHU WILL RETIRE FROM THE BOARD EFFECTIVE MAY 2023, AS HE WILL REACH THE MANDATORY RETIREMENT AGE UNDER THE COMPANY'S DIRECTOR RETIREMENT POLICY."}